    "description": "Core banking is the software foundation that processes banking transactions and maintains customer accounts and financial records. In Iran, suppliers such as Dotin and Tosan form part of the domestic banking technology ecosystem, although their product descriptions alone do not establish comparative performance or market share. [s1][s2][s4]",
